      ],
      "text": "Singular or unstable stiffness behaviour often indicates degrees of freedom that can move without enough resistance, but the cause must be localized before changing the authored model."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "locator": "Connectivity FAQ",
